WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.370
- Having your movies out in a pandemic,

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.880
has anyone had the chance to like,

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:04.713
ask you for your autograph?

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:07.490
I mean, it's kind of weird
'cause you're not really out.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:10.330
So have people really
noticed you anywhere yet?

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:12.080
- You know what, I,

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.450
that hasn't really happened yet.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.400
Like, I haven't had a,
sign my first autograph

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.370
or anything but just online,

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.870
I've kind of seen through the critics

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.240
and through social media,
certain fans that have,

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.990
people have really been
responding to the work,

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.100
which is, it's a nice feeling, yeah.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.710
- Wait, are you saying
that you haven't actually

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.800
signed an autograph yet?

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.550
- I, when I was a basketball player,

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.930
I signed a couple for like
kids and stuff, but no,

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.050
I've never signed one for acting.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:36.883
Not yet, no.

00:00:36.883 --> 00:00:38.520
- Oh my gosh, can I be your first?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.353
Will you sign it?

00:00:39.353 --> 00:00:40.880
I loved you in the movie.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.360
Will you sign an autograph for me?

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.455
I'm going to put it up in my studio.

00:00:44.455 --> 00:00:45.288
- Wait, are you serious?

00:00:45.288 --> 00:00:46.255
- Yes.

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:47.245
- Okay, I mean.

00:00:47.245 --> 00:00:48.360
- I want you to sign something for me,

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.553
I'm gonna put it up in my studio.

00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:51.649
- Kelly, is there any
way, 'cause my sister,

00:00:51.649 --> 00:00:52.482
I gotta say.

00:00:52.482 --> 00:00:54.930
Wait, Kelly, Kelly, all right,

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.390
I was trying to play cool
throughout the interview,

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:57.550
but I got to get down for a second.

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:59.150
My sisters and my parents and I,

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.240
we watched every single
episode of the first season

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.537
of American Idol.

00:01:02.537 --> 00:01:05.600
So this is like, so what I'm saying is.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.500
- Are you Team Justin or Team Kelly?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:08.350
I'm just kidding.

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:10.890
- How 'bout this, how 'bout this?

00:01:10.890 --> 00:01:12.630
I mean, I've seen the movie,

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.220
I've saw from Justin to Kelly, so both.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.660
- Oh my God, that was
contractually obligated.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:18.588
While you have...

00:01:18.588 --> 00:01:19.534
- My sisters and I loved it,

00:01:19.534 --> 00:01:20.552
my sisters and I loved it.

00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:21.750
We have to take that somewhere.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.690
- But I love that y'all
watched the first season.

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:24.870
That's that's so cool.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.560
Okay, I promise you this,

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.640
I'll sign something for your family

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:28.610
if you send something for me.

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:30.050
- I was gonna say, my sisters and my mom

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:31.360
will kill me if I don't return.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:32.880
So can we do like a little trade off?

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:33.713
Is that, is that cool?

00:01:33.713 --> 00:01:34.990
- Yes, tradesies.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.850
And I'm not kidding, the next
time you come to my studio,

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.413
I'm gonna have it like, hanging
up in the room you're in.

